# Ignore everything by default
*

# Un-ignore directories so git will look inside them
!*/

# Un-ignore the file types you actually want tracked
!*.py
!*.yaml
!*.yml
!*.sh

# Explicitly re-ignore the risky extensions even inside otherwise-allowed dirs
# (belt-and-suspenders on top of the deny-all above)
*.jsonl
*.out
*.err
*.txt
huggingface/
wandb/
unsloth_compiled_cache/
models/
models*/

# A few common repo files worth keeping
!.gitignore
!README.md
!requirements.txt